WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.041 --> 00:00:02.958
[stadium crowd noise]

00:00:03.916 --> 00:00:04.625
(A.C. Slater)
All right!

00:00:04.666 --> 00:00:07.916
(Team)
[cheering]

00:00:07.916 --> 00:00:09.666
(A.C. Slater)
This is it, guys!

00:00:09.833 --> 00:00:10.666
(Aisha)
And girl.

00:00:10.666 --> 00:00:12.166
(A.C. Slater)
Right, I wouldn’t want to forget about

00:00:12.166 --> 00:00:14.041
(A.C. Slater)
our star quarterback-ette.

00:00:14.583 --> 00:00:16.458
(A.C. Slater)
Our...  quarterbacktress!

00:00:17.583 --> 00:00:18.375
(A.C. Slater)
Quarterwoman?

00:00:18.375 --> 00:00:19.375
(Aisha)
Just quarterback.

00:00:19.708 --> 00:00:21.916
(A.C. Slater)
It is Bayside versus Valley,

00:00:21.916 --> 00:00:24.333
(A.C. Slater)
it is the biggest game in the country!

00:00:24.666 --> 00:00:25.708
(Jamie)
Oooff, Coach,

00:00:25.708 --> 00:00:27.666
(Jamie)
what about the match up on NBC?

00:00:27.666 --> 00:00:30.458
(Jamie)
That is objectively a way bigger game than this.

00:00:31.541 --> 00:00:33.375
(A.C. Slater)
Well, debatable.

00:00:33.458 --> 00:00:35.416
(A.C. Slater)
We need to work together as a group.

00:00:35.416 --> 00:00:36.000
(Aisha)
Hey Coach!

00:00:36.375 --> 00:00:37.833
(Aisha)
Back to the football comparison,

00:00:38.125 --> 00:00:39.500
(Aisha)
record breaking plays,

00:00:39.500 --> 00:00:41.208
(Aisha)
Hall of Fame seasons and...

00:00:41.625 --> 00:00:42.708
(Aisha)
they’re professional athletes.

00:00:42.708 --> 00:00:43.875
(Jamie)
Yeah, and we’re just  a  high school team

00:00:43.875 --> 00:00:44.875
(Jamie)
that hasn’t won a game in like

00:00:44.875 --> 00:00:46.250
(Jamie)
twenty-seven years.

00:00:46.416 --> 00:00:48.333
(A.C. Slater)
Okay, but...

00:00:48.333 --> 00:00:50.250
(A.C. Slater)
let’s focus on this game, because...

00:00:50.250 --> 00:00:51.333
(Aisha)
Hey, did you guys catch

00:00:51.333 --> 00:00:52.875
(Aisha)
last week’s game, because

00:00:52.875 --> 00:00:54.541
(Aisha)
my Fantasy Football running back

00:00:54.541 --> 00:00:55.833
(Aisha)
got thirty-eight points.

00:00:56.208 --> 00:00:57.625
(Aisha)
How’d that L taste, Jamie?

00:00:57.625 --> 00:00:58.208
(Team)
Ohhhhh!

00:00:58.208 --> 00:00:59.208
(Jamie)
Please stop reminding me.

00:00:59.208 --> 00:01:01.375
(Jamie)
It’s not my fault that I forgot to start a defense.

00:01:01.375 --> 00:01:02.625
(Aisha)
Uh, actually it is.

00:01:02.625 --> 00:01:03.625
(A.C. Slater)
Guys, guys!

00:01:04.333 --> 00:01:05.208
(A.C. Slater)
Ehh and girl!

00:01:05.416 --> 00:01:06.291
(A.C. Slater)
My point is...

00:01:06.750 --> 00:01:08.083
(A.C. Slater)
this is a big game.

00:01:08.625 --> 00:01:09.875
(A.C. Slater)
This is our time.

00:01:10.416 --> 00:01:13.250
(A.C. Slater)
It is Bayside versus Valley.

00:01:13.416 --> 00:01:15.666
(A.C. Slater)
This game is huge.

00:01:15.666 --> 00:01:18.333
(A.C. Slater)
Everyone is gonna be watching.

00:01:18.333 --> 00:01:19.500
(Jamie)
My parents aren’t here,

00:01:19.500 --> 00:01:20.333
(Jamie)
they’re at home

00:01:20.333 --> 00:01:22.166
(Jamie)
watching the football game on NBC.

00:01:22.250 --> 00:01:23.208
(Aisha)
Speaking of watching,

00:01:23.208 --> 00:01:25.125
(Aisha)
are they going to be showing the game on the sidelines?

00:01:25.291 --> 00:01:26.208
(A.C. Slater)
I give up.

00:01:26.375 --> 00:01:27.916
(A.C. Slater)
I’m going to the Max to have some soup.

00:01:28.625 --> 00:01:28.958
[clap]

00:01:29.041 --> 00:01:29.375
[clap]

